---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Overview - Explore About Us" 
  description="Overview of the Jammu & Kashmir State Power Development Corporation (JKSPDC)."
>
  <div class="space-y-0">
    <!-- Branded Page Header Band -->
    <div class="-mx-4 sm:-mx-6 lg:-mx-8 -mt-8 mb-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1B3A6B] to-[#0B4F9C]">
      <nav class="text-xs text-white/70 mb-2" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
        <ol class="flex gap-2">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a></li>
          <li class="text-white/50">/</li>
          <li><span class="text-white/70">About Us</span></li>
          <li class="text-white/50">/</li>
          <li><span class="text-white/70">Explore</span></li>
          <li class="text-white/50">/</li>
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Overview</span></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">Corporate Overview</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-white/75 mt-1">Introduction and profile of the corporation's key milestones and jurisdiction.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Main Text -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6">
        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-[1.65]">
          <strong>Jammu and Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)</strong> is a wholly owned Public Sector Undertaking (PSU) of the Government of Jammu & Kashmir.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-[1.65]">
          Incorporated in 1995 under the Companies Act, the Corporation was established with the mandate to take over, execute, complete and operate power stations and power projects of the erstwhile Jammu & Kashmir State.
        </p>

        <div id="historical-legacy" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0B4F9C]/5 to-[#004488]/5 border-l-4 border-[#0B4F9C] p-4 rounded-r-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] text-sm">Key Historical Legacy</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-[1.65]">
            The journey of J&K in power development began with the historic <strong>4MW Mohra Hydroelectric Plant in 1905</strong>, marking the start of a rich legacy. Currently, JKSPDCL operates 13 Hydroelectric Projects (HEPs) across the UT of Jammu & Kashmir, with a total installed capacity of <strong>1197.4 MW</strong>, including the flagship 900 MW Baglihar Hydroelectric Project.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-[1.65]">
          The power generated by the Corporation primarily caters to the Union Territory's energy needs, with power being sold to UT's DISCOMs (namely KPDCL and JPDCL) through JKPCL (Trade Co). Apart from providing power to local DISCOMs, JKSPDCL also sells power to other State utilities through trading entities like PTC India Ltd., IEX and Haryana Power Purchase Centre.
        </p>

        <h3 id="capital-structure" class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] pt-2">Capital Structure & Investment Portfolio</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-[1.65]">
          JKSPDCL has an authorised share capital of <strong>Rs. 5000 crores</strong>, paid up share capital of <strong>Rs. 2593.3443 crores</strong> and an investment of <strong>Rs. 2357.61 crores</strong> in its joint ventures companies with NHPC namely:
        </p>
        
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-2 leading-[1.65]">
          <li><strong>Chenab Valley Power Projects Pvt. Ltd. (CVPPPL)</strong>: Incorporated in 2011, currently constructing 4 large projects in Chenab basin with combined installed capacity of 3094 MW (Pakal Dul 1000MW, Kiru 624MW, Kwar 540MW expected to be commissioned in 2026, and Kirthai-II 930MW under clearance).</li>
          <li><strong>Ratle Hydroelectric Power Corporation Limited (RHPCL)</strong>: Established in 2021, dedicated to implementing the 850 MW Ratle Hydroelectric Project, slated to be commissioned by May, 2026.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 id="ongoing-projects" class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0B4F9C] pt-2">Ongoing Projects & Future Mandate</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-[1.65]">
          On its own, JKSPDCL is engaged in the construction of 37.5 MW Parnai HEP and 12 MW Karnah HEP. Further, 93 MW New Ganderbal HEP and 48 MW Lower Kalnai HEP are at the stage of award, and the 390 MW Kirthai-I HEP is under appraisal stage. 
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-[1.65]">
          The company is also looking to foray into the core Renewable Energy segment like solar, wind, green hydrogen and hybrid by leveraging its experienced manpower, vast land and water assets and thus become part of the nation's energy transition towards renewables, contributing towards our nation meeting its 50% energy requirement from renewable energy by 2030, as part of India's "Panchamrit" pledge held out in UN Climate Change Conference in 2021.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Sidebar: On This Page + Quick Navigation -->
      <aside class="space-y-4">
        <!-- On This Page (Sticky TOC) -->
        <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-4">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">On This Page</h3>
            <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-xs text-slate-600">
              <li><a href="#historical-legacy" class="hover:text-[#0B4F9C] hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1"><span class="text-slate-300">›</span> Key Historical Legacy</a></li>
              <li><a href="#capital-structure" class="hover:text-[#0B4F9C] hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1"><span class="text-slate-300">›</span> Capital Structure & Investment</a></li>
              <li><a href="#ongoing-projects" class="hover:text-[#0B4F9C] hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1"><span class="text-slate-300">›</span> Ongoing Projects & Future Mandate</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#EAF4FF] rounded-xl border border-[#BDD7EE] p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1B3A6B] text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#BDD7EE]">Related Pages</h3>
            <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#0B4F9C]">
              <li><a href="/about-us/explore/vision" class="hover:underline block py-0.5">&rarr; Vision Statement</a></li>
              <li><a href="/about-us/explore/mission" class="hover:underline block py-0.5">&rarr; Mission Statement</a></li>
              <li><a href="/about-us/explore/profile" class="hover:underline block py-0.5">&rarr; Corporate Profile</a></li>
              <li><a href="/about-us/explore/objectives" class="hover:underline block py-0.5">&rarr; Main Objectives</a></li>
              <li><a href="/about-us/management/board" class="hover:underline block py-0.5">&rarr; Board of Directors</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
